nd shopping malls. It also has a number of amenities, including a swimming pool, a gym, a playground, and a security system.\r\n\r\nShrishti Residency is the perfect place to call home. With its excellent location, amenities, and affordable prices, it is sure to please even the most discerning buyer. So what are you waiting for? Contact us today to book your dream home!","location":{"address":{"addressCountry":"IN","streetAddress":"Indira Nagar","addressLocality":"Jogeshwari","type":"PostalAddress","addressRegion":"Western Suburbs, Mumbai"},"@type":"Place","name":", Mumbai"},"eventAttendanceMode":"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode","url":"https://dwello.in/view/nicco-shrishti-residency-by-new-india-construction-company-at-jogeshwari_dcee5be9-0b06-4d32-b777-a1c325b28308","startDate":"2022-01-01"},"brand":"New India Construction Company"}]</script><meta name="robots" content="index,follow" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="11 New Residential Real estate Projects by New India Construction Company for sale on dwello.in., Search for all Under construction, Ready to move in, Upcoming, Pre-Launch, New launch, Projects by New India Construction Company, Get 2D/3D floor plans, pricing, project location, real photos, original videos brochure, project reviews only on dwello.in" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image:src" content="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/VKazkHPbobE8svfWD6kuMO95Ybc2aNhYFFg-mvO26jjiZ5Kt_YziqlR6URKk7gpzKlLRP5F0bO41b6SUdI8yUxA-fVzvjPkO_V0" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Projects by New India Construction Company" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:url" content="https://dwello.in/projects/homes-by-new-india-construction-company" data-next-head=""/><meta property="dwello:pageType" content="Explore" data-next-head=""/><link rel="preconnect" href="//cdn.dwello.in"/><link rel="preconnect" href="//lh3.googleusercon